																								<r3d:remarks>www.datacenterhub.org was established at Purdue University in 2014 to preserve data and digital infrastructure that were available after the Network for Earthquake Engineering Simulation (NEES) was terminated by National Science Foundation NSF. Datacenterhub was funded by the NSF until 2021 through two grants: 1443027 and 1724728. In the second of those two grants, datacenterhub was associated with the acronym DEEDS.</r3d:remarks>
